{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","title":"AttributedString.WritingDirection","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WritingDirection","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WritingDirection","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"26.0"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"26.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"26.0"},{"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","beta":false}],"modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"extendedModule":"FoundationEssentials","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials16AttributedStringV16WritingDirectionO","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"enum"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Working-with-writing-directions","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft"],"title":"Working with writing directions"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/init(from:)"],"anchor":"Encoding-and-decoding","title":"Encoding and decoding"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Supporting types","generated":true,"anchor":"Supporting-types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/AttributeInvalidationCondition","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/UTF16View","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/UTF8View","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/AttributeRunBoundaries"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s12CaseIterableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/Se","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SE","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SQ","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SH","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WritingDirection","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing direction defines the base direction in which bidirectional text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lays out its directional runs. A directional run is a contiguous sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of characters that all have the same effective directionality, which can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be determined using the Unicode BiDi algorithm. The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"writing direction puts the directional run that is placed first in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"storage leftmost, and places subsequent directional runs towards the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right. The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" writing direction puts the directional run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that is placed first in the storage rightmost, and places subsequent"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directional runs towards the left.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that writing direction is a property separate from a text’s","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alignment, its line layout direction, or its character direction."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, it is often used to determine the default alignment of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paragraph. E.g. English (a language with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/leftToRight","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"characterDirection","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", as defined by the FoundationInternationalization module) is usually aligned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the left, but may be centered or aligned to the right for special"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effect, or to be visually more appealing in a user interface."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For bidirectional text to be perceived as laid out correctly, make sure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the writing direction is set to the value equivalent to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"characterDirection","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"of the primary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language in the text. E.g. an English sentence that contains some"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Arabic (a language with"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/rightToLeft","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" value for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"characterDirection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") words, should use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" writing direction. An Arabic sentence that contains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"some English words, should use a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" writing direction.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Writing direction is always orthogonoal to the line layout direction","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"chosen to display a certain text. The line layout direction is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"direction in which a sequence of lines is placed in. E.g. English text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is usually displayed with a line layout direction of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/topToBottom"},{"type":"text","text":". While languages do"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have an associated line language direction (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lineLayoutDirection"},{"type":"text","text":" in FoundationInternationalization), not all displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of text follow the line layout direction of the text’s primary language."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Horizontal script is script with a line layout direction of either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/topToBottom","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/bottomToTop","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Vertical script","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/leftToRight","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/rightToLeft","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" line layout","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"direction. In vertical scripts, a writing direction of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is interpreted as top-to-bottom and a writing direction of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft","type":"reference"},{"text":" is interpreted as bottom-to-top.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The writing direction of a piece of text."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/attributedstring\/writingdirection"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/Locale/LanguageDirection/topToBottom":{"url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/locale\/languagedirection\/toptobottom","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"topToBottom"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The language direction is from top to bottom."}],"title":"Locale.LanguageDirection.topToBottom","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/topToBottom","kind":"symbol"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/AttributedString/WritingDirection":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The writing direction of a piece of text."}],"title":"AttributedString.WritingDirection","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WritingDirection"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/attributedstring\/writingdirection","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WritingDirection"}]},"doc://Found